# Dillo cookie policy. Symlink next to dillorc (~/.dillo/ or ~/.config/dillo/).
# Rules are matched top-down; DEFAULT is the fallback.
#   DENY           reject all cookies (most private)
#   ACCEPT_SESSION keep cookies only until Dillo quits
#   ACCEPT         persist cookies to disk
# Add per-host exceptions ABOVE the DEFAULT line, e.g.:
#   example.com  ACCEPT_SESSION

DEFAULT  DENY
